sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Identity as Identity Service (Cloudflare)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    
    Client->>Identity: Login Request
    Identity->>Identity: Validate Credentials (bcrypt)
    Identity->>Client: Return JWT & JWE Cookie
    
    Client->>Gateway: GraphQL Query + Cookies
    Gateway->>Gateway: Verify JWT Signature locally
    Gateway->>DB: CTE Auth Check (RBAC)
    DB-->>Gateway: Data or Access Denied
    Gateway-->>Client: Response
